This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The shared-memory layout, field order and validity handling were informed by
reading, and only reading, the following upstream projects:

- BigscreenVR/VRCFT-Beyond (https://github.com/BigscreenVR/VRCFT-Beyond),
  the official VRCFaceTracking module whose C# SharedGazeData declaration is
  the primary reference for the wire format.
- zenuru-merps/ResoniteBeyond2eDriver
  (https://github.com/zenuru-merps/ResoniteBeyond2eDriver), an independent
  C# reader of the same mapping.
- Zakhazerd/vrupscale (https://github.com/Zakhazerd/vrupscale), an
  independent C++ reader of the same mapping.
- ClassicWasTaken/FaceTrackingBridge
  (https://github.com/ClassicWasTaken/FaceTrackingBridge), which loads the
  official module and documents the user-facing prerequisite.

This repository is an independent C++ implementation of that community
reverse-engineered wire format and contains none of their source code. The
format has no official documentation; see docs/protocol.md for what is
confirmed and what is not.

